  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Child Project of the Global Clean Hydrogen Programme of Ecuador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The present Child Project of Ecuador is part of the Global Clean Hydrogen Programme (GEF-8). This project aims to enhancing national institutional capacities, enabling policy frameworks, improving technological readiness at industrial level, and financial mechanisms for the successful uptake of clean hydrogen in Ecuador, to ensure its net zero development with social considerations and benefits.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEF - Global Environment Facility</narrative>
